== CANON-8 (generic-struct-methods): methods of generic structs, one

== generic-struct-methods (Q2): a method has no type parameters of its own yet.
Type
    TPair<K, V> Struct
        FKey K
        FValue V
    ;
    TPoint Struct
        FX Integer := 0
    ;

TPair<K, V>.Map<U>(Self) :
    PutLn("x")
;

Main :
    PutLn(1)
;
